{'symbol': 'MAA', 'date': '2019-09-25 22:30:00', 'title': 'MAA APPROVES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON OCTOBER 31, 2019', 'text': 'MAA ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $0.96 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO BE PAID ON OCTOBER 31, 2019 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON OCTOBER 15, 2019.'}